  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "部门负责人每周经营复盘表",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": 1,
      "space_before_pt": 8.0,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 18.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "text": "用于部门问题雷达、团队观察、机制沉淀与经营闭环推进",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": 1,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 10.5,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": 2.0,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": null,
      "font_size_pt": null,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": null,
      "font_size_pt": null,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "text": "一、填写规则",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": 18.0,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "text": "• 不要写“已沟通、已处理、持续跟进”这类空话，必须写出事实、数据、责任人、时间点、交付物和检查方式。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 10.5,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "text": "• 红色代表已经影响部门结果或需要上级介入；黄色代表存在风险，需要部门负责人推动闭环；绿色代表正常推进。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 10.5,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "text": "• 每周至少沉淀一个 SOP、模板、检查表、话术或流程优化，让部门问题处理后变成可复用的组织能力。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 10.5,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "text": "二、经营总判断",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": 18.0,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": 2.0,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": null,
      "font_size_pt": null,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "text": "三、问题雷达",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": null,
      "space_before_pt": 18.0,
      "space_after_pt": 4.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.15,
      "font_name": "Microsoft YaHei",
